msgid "%(curation)s: a public curation, by its name or the short name under it. Search %(curation)s to find them; <code>%(in_curation)s</code> narrows a post search to that curation's guilds and accounts. Private curations are never found."
msgstr "%(curation)sEn offentlig kuratert fôr, etter navnet eller det korte navnet under den. Søk %(curation)s å finne dem; <code>%(in_curation)s</code> begrenser et postsøk til den kurerte matens laug og kontoer. Private kurater finnes aldri."

