msgstr "Curated feed Mention"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Custom Formatting"
msgstr "Tilpasset formatering"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "DO NOT reveal your Client Secret. Anyone with your Client Secret will be able to pretend to be you. You are responsible for keeping your Client Secret a secret!"
msgstr "Ikke avsløre kundehemmeligheten din. Alle med din kundehemmelighet kan late som om de er deg. Du er ansvarlig for å holde din klient hemmelig!"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Days are in UTC. <code>%(before)s</code> and <code>%(after)s</code> leave the day itself out; <code>%(since)s</code> and <code>%(until)s</code> include it."
msgstr "Dager er i UTC. <code>%(before)s</code> og <code>%(after)s</code> la dagen være ute; <code>%(since)s</code> og <code>%(until)s</code> Inkluder det."

